      <div type="clause" n="Rb I 5.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:InCn">In Cn</ref> Rb I 5.2</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="In Cn Rb I 5.2" corresp="#wit-lat"><pb n="616" ed="#liebermann"/>De uulgari sacerdote non casto<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="b" target="#InCn_Rb-I-5-2.lnote.oe.b"/>.</ab>
        <note type="editorial">New row (October 2026): Liebermann’s text transcribed from Gesetze I p. 616 (two independent readings of the page images, differences settled against the page)</note>
        <note type="liebermannNote" subtype="textual" xml:id="InCn_Rb-I-5-2.lnote.oe.b" n="b" source="#liebermann"><bibl><biblScope unit="volume">1</biblScope><biblScope unit="page">616</biblScope></bibl><seg type="original" xml:lang="de"><hi rend="italic">in Cb folgt</hi> Nola bouis — — libras tres, <hi rend="italic">d. i. Schluss der</hi> Consiliatio Cnuti <hi rend="italic">aus</hi> Hundred 8 <hi rend="italic">f., oben S.</hi> 195 = <hi rend="italic">u. S.</hi> 619{10}, <hi rend="italic">dann</hi> Wl art., <hi rend="italic">o. S.</hi> 486. <hi rend="italic">Auch in HRl</hi> [<hi rend="italic">wo erst</hi> CHn cor. <hi rend="italic">eingefügt</hi>] <hi rend="italic">folgt</hi> Wl art. <hi rend="italic">Hier endet T.</hi></seg><seg type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude">in Cb there follows Nola bouis — — libras tres, i.e. the end of the Consiliatio Cnuti from Hundred 8 f., above p. 195 = below p. 619{10}, then Wl art., above p. 486. In HRl too [where CHn cor. is inserted first] Wl art. follows. T ends here.</seg></note>
        <note type="liebermannNote" subtype="textual" xml:id="InCn_Rb-I-5-2.lnote.oe.b-2" n="b" source="#liebermann"><bibl><biblScope unit="volume">1</biblScope><biblScope unit="page">616</biblScope></bibl><seg type="original" xml:lang="de"><hi rend="italic"><hi rend="spaced">gesperrt</hi> drucke ich die Wörter, die von Cb’s <hi rend="spaced">Texte</hi> der</hi> In Cn <hi rend="italic">abweichen</hi></seg><seg type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude">I print in <hi rend="italic">spaced type</hi> the words that differ from Cb's <hi rend="italic">text</hi> of the In Cn</seg></note>
      </div>
    </body>
